  m_Text: "WASD / left stick   move\nSpace / A   jump + double + triple\nShift / L3   sprint      Ctrl / RT   play tile\nV / Y   camera view      Backspace / Select   respawn\nL   free play: walk-on / landing only\nM   palm mute      N   mute all strings\nTAB / PAD WEST / I   interval selection menu\nEsc / Start   pause      Enter / A   confirm\n\nCHORDS  F P5   J P5\u2193   E m3   R M3\n        T P4   Y M2   C m6   G M6\n        H m7   Z m2   X TT   B M7   Q 8va\n        1 m9   2 M9   3 m10  4 M10  5 P11\n        6 A11  7 P12  8 m13  9 M13  0 m14\n        - M14  = P15"
